        "Content": "Teffia Park, Longford Town, a most popular and sought-after residential area.\r\nNo.75 is a well placed residence on the outer perimeter of houses and overlooking the beautiful and well maintained green\r\n\r\nAccommodation Includes  :\r\nEntrance Hall  :  1.8 x 2.8\r\nLiving room  :  4.7 x 3.8 + 1.3 x 2.8. Open fireplace.\r\nKitchen / Dining area  :  3.9 x 3.9  Modern fitted units, patio door to garden and decking area.\r\nPantry  : 2.7 x 0.8   (Off kitchen).\r\nBathroom  :  3.2 x 1.9. Wall and floor tiling, excellent fit-out.\r\nBedroom 1.  :  2.9 x 4.7. Carpet, wardrobe.\r\nBedroom 2.  :  3.0 x 3.2.  Carpet, wardrobe.\r\nBedroom 3.  :  2.7 x 2.2. Carpet.\r\n\r\nOutside  :\r\nBoundary wall, pedestrian entrance and lawn area to front.\r\nPrivate Garden to rear with mature planting, beautifully manicured grounds.\r\nThere is also a garage with storage / utility space.\r\nThe garage has roller door and access to service lane at rear.\r\n\r\nThis is truly a select property. Inside the décor and fit-out is extremely elegant and stylish.\r\nOutside, the gardens are an oasis of privacy and peace seldom attainable in urban settings.\r\n\r\nThis may well be the property you were waiting for, to arrange your viewing contact John, 043 3341176 or 086 8346559 at any time."
      },
